Thank you for this morning's discussion. I confirm your decision to defer the=
 start this period and to continue ordinary payments on the current route. Ea=
ch March candidate has two of the three required working windows; the third i=
s occupied by close preparation. The comparison and the separate slot totals =
are attached for your Japan Finance discussion.

Before we hold another week, could you return both the regular payment and cl=
ose rotas showing that the primary and deputy are free for the first three co=
nsecutive 90-minute windows, and confirm the deputy's 07 authority? Siobhan a=
nd Neha will check the handover and evidence requirements, and Connor will ch=
eck the original records for the four weeks before a proposed start. We can t=
hen identify a candidate together; your approval will be needed before starti=
ng.

The 09 change remains a separate decision. We have not agreed a replacement w=
eek.

Best,
Nicholas

